{"text":"都綰闕口游激校尉司馬解伯達造彌勒像一區。願皇道赫寧，九荒沾泯；父母康延，智登十地；仕達日遷，眷屬道場；聲求嚮和，斯福必就。六趣群生，咸同此願。太和年造。","tags":[{"name":"LocName","term":"伊闕","refId":"PL000000023647","text":"闕口","start":2,"end":4},{"name":"PersonName","term":"解伯達","refId":null,"text":"解伯達","start":10,"end":13},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"彌勒","refId":null,"text":"彌勒","start":14,"end":16},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"十地","refId":null,"text":"十地","start":38,"end":40},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"六趣","refId":null,"text":"六趣","start":61,"end":63},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"眾生","refId":null,"text":"群生","start":63,"end":65}]}